// @contract: C-101
// Graduated from proofs/wall-corpus/list_of_maps_loop_build.almd at the commissioning
// switchover: the structural emitter lowers the shape the incumbent
// refused (heap reassignment inside a control-flow frame), byte-verified on both targets.
// `List[Map[String, Int]]` grown in a loop: a fresh Map var per iteration,
// written through `map.set` and then pushed. The map's set is a REASSIGNING
// write (the COW slot store) inside the loop frame, which the brick refuses
// rather than defer into a silent no-op. The same accumulation over
// `List[List[Int]]` with one fresh list var lowers and votes
// (spec/wasm_cross/nested_list_list_int.almd).
fn main() -> Unit = {
  var lm: List[Map[String, Int]] = []
  var i = 0
  while i < 3 {
    var e: Map[String, Int] = map.new()
    map.set(e, "id", i)
    list.push(lm, e)
    i = i + 1
  }
  println(int.to_string(list.fold(lm, 0, (a, e) => a + map.get_or(e, "id", 0))))
}
